<Base title="About" description="Why 815live exists: Rockford-area live music listings that don't require a Facebook account.">
  <h1>About 815live</h1>
  <p>
    Most local shows in Rockford, Loves Park and Belvidere only get posted on Facebook. 815live collects them in one
    place: who's playing, where, when, and what it costs, no account needed.
  </p>
  <p>
    The focus is local bands at bars, breweries and small venues. You can subscribe to the{' '}
    <a href="/calendar.ics">calendar feed</a> or <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>Venues and bands</h2>
  <p>
    Playing a show or booking one? <a href="/submit">Submit it here</a> with the date, start time, venue, lineup and
    cover, and it'll get listed.
  </p>
  <p class="lede">This page is a placeholder.</p>
</Base>
